          <p>
            County Governance Watch (CGW) is a legally registered NGO (Reg. No.
            OP.218/051/15-052/9805) working to advance transparent, accountable,
            and inclusive governance across Kenya's 47 counties.
          </p>
          <p>
            Since inception, CGW has partnered with county governments, national
            agencies, and civil society to enhance public participation and
            strengthen service delivery in devolved units. 
          </p>
