            The organisation's work is grounded in two complementary approaches:
            <span class="font-medium"
              >developing evidence-based governance assessment tools,</span
            >
            and
            <span class="font-medium"
              >creating structured citizen–leader engagement platforms.</span
            >
          </p>
          <p>
            This dual method bridges the gap between policy commitments and
            community realities, ensuring that the voices of ordinary Kenyans
            are heard at the highest levels of county governance. CGW's
            2025–2030 Strategic Plan seeks to expand coverage to all 47 counties
            and strengthen Kenya's governance culture.
          </p>
